secure-vk-api
An independently modified fork of python273/vk_api 11.10.1.
Upstream: https://github.com/python273/vk_api
Upstream copyright (c) 2019 python273 and respective contributing authors.
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modified on 2026-11-06 for the private VK music Telegram bot project:
- vk_api/vk_api.py: memory-only config, limited scope, explicit app identity,
  removed sensitive log values, password attribute cleanup, safe transport.
- vk_api/utils.py: removed credential-bearing HTTP debug dumping.
- vk_api/longpoll.py, bot_longpoll.py, upload.py: share SafeSession restrictions.
- vk_api/__init__.py: fork version and separate upstream version metadata.
- vk_api/audio.py: explicit web-session constructor without an OAuth app_id,
  opt-in strict enumeration/batch completeness checks for library snapshots.
- vk_api/secure_config.py and secure_transport.py: new security boundaries.
- Packaging, tests, Docker configuration and documentation added by this fork.

This project is not an official VK product and is not endorsed by VK or the
upstream maintainers. Upstream compatibility and live VK availability are
not guaranteed. The remaining upstream modules have not had a full audit.
